==Strategy==
Here, the difficulty is increased, as The Face appears at 200% magnification, and One Horn and Jackie Peng are 400%. Unfortunately, zero times two is still zero. Simply using [[Giraffe Cat]] to clear out the Metal Balls and using [[Whale Cat]] and [[Dragon Cat]] should easily beat this stage.

